****************************************************

NOTE TO PEOPLE UPDATING FROM VERSION 2.00 TO 2.01

****************************************************

Because of the nature of some of the bugs in v2.00 , the datafiles you have
are not compatible with this 2.01 version.  Unfortunately, you will have to
reset the game.  If you are not experiencing any difficulties with version
2.00, then you may want to wait until someone wins the game until you do a
reset.  To do a reset, you run the DSEcfg program and click on the Reset
Game button.

-David Prothero
